|-| Melee (Mountain trolls) =

Meleeing mountain trolls is an easy and accessible option for a Troll task with no quest requirements to complete, and with all damage able to be completely negated through [[Protect from Melee]].

[[Protect from melee]] and [[Piety]] are strongly recommended, although forgoing one or both and using [[Bones to peaches]] is viable, albeit significantly slower. [[Thralls]] and [[Death charge]] on the [[Arceuus spellbook]] can be used to speed up the task significantly, in addition to a [[Dwarf multicannon]]. This also allows players to use [[Adept reanimation]] on any [[ensouled troll head]]s received on the task.

Players may also wish to use equipment such as [[Sunfire fanatic armour]], [[Proselyte armour|Proselyte]], or [[Initiate armour]] to maximise prayer bonus, especially if combined with a [[Bonecrusher necklace]] to minimise prayer potion usage.

